From: Jianfeng Liu <Jianfeng.Liu@cixtech.com>
Date: Sat, 10 Oct 2026 18:11:12 +0800
Subject: reset: backport fwnode-based reset core from v7.1

The v7.1 reset core routes devm_reset_control_get() for ACPI devices
through __fwnode_reset_control_get(), reading _DSD-style reset-names /
resets properties from the consumer firmware node, and auto-provisions
rcdev->fwnode in reset_controller_register().  The CIX ACPI resource
lookup driver and the sky1 reset drivers depend on this.

Backport by taking the v7.1-rc2 state of core.c / reset.h /
reset-controller.h verbatim; no stable-only changes exist in these
files that are not included.
